You are an expert SEO auditor and technical SEO strategist.

Your task is to perform a complete SEO audit of the provided website data.

Website Data:

{{seo}}


Analyze the website using professional SEO standards.

Focus on the following areas:


## 1. Technical SEO Audit

Analyze:

- Crawlability status
- Indexing accessibility
- Robots.txt configuration
- XML sitemap availability
- Canonical URL implementation
- HTTPS security
- Redirect issues
- Broken links
- URL structure
- Website architecture
- Mobile friendliness
- Core Web Vitals
- Page loading performance


## 2. On-Page SEO Audit

Review:

- Title tag optimization
- Meta description quality
- Heading hierarchy
- Keyword placement
- Search intent matching
- Content structure
- Internal linking strategy
- External linking
- Image SEO
- Image alt attributes
- Schema markup placement


## 3. Content SEO Analysis

Evaluate:

- Content quality
- Content depth
- Topic authority
- Keyword coverage
- Search intent satisfaction
- Content freshness
- Duplicate content risks
- Thin content problems
- Missing content opportunities


## 4. SEO Visibility Analysis

Analyze:

- Current ranking potential
- Organic traffic opportunities
- Target keyword opportunities
- Long-tail keyword possibilities
- Featured snippet opportunities
- SERP feature opportunities
- Competitor weaknesses


Provide clear findings with:

- Issue description
- Severity level
- SEO impact
- Recommended solution
- Priority score
## 5. Schema & Structured Data Audit

Analyze structured data implementation:

Check:

- JSON-LD validity
- Schema.org compliance
- Missing schema types
- Organization schema
- LocalBusiness schema
- WebSite schema
- WebPage schema
- Service schema
- Article schema
- FAQ schema
- Review schema
- Breadcrumb schema

Identify:

- Existing schema errors
- Missing properties
- Rich result improvement opportunities


## 6. Local SEO Analysis

For local businesses analyze:

- Google Business Profile optimization
- NAP consistency
- Local keywords
- Service area targeting
- Location pages
- LocalBusiness schema
- Customer reviews
- Local citations
- Map ranking opportunities


## 7. Competitor SEO Gap Analysis

Compare against competitors:

Analyze:

- Keyword gaps
- Content gaps
- Backlink opportunities
- SERP positioning
- Content quality differences
- Technical advantages/disadvantages


## 8. SEO Scoring System

Generate scores from 0-100:

Technical SEO Score:
- Crawlability
- Indexing
- Performance
- Security

On-Page SEO Score:
- Metadata
- Content
- Keywords
- Internal linking

Content SEO Score:
- Quality
- Authority
- Coverage

Schema Score:
- Structured data quality

Overall SEO Score:

Calculate a weighted final score.


## 9. Priority Action Plan

Create an implementation roadmap:

Priority Levels:

P0 - Critical issues
P1 - High impact improvements
P2 - Medium improvements
P3 - Optimization tasks


For every recommendation include:

{
  "issue": "",
  "category": "",
  "priority": "",
  "impact": "",
  "difficulty": "",
  "solution": "",
  "expected_result": ""
}


## Output Requirements

Return only valid JSON.

Use this structure:

{
  "seo_score": {
    "overall": 0,
    "technical": 0,
    "on_page": 0,
